silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_02_mittens_anchor_yoneda_hom_leg_6_tau_taxon silm:hasExample "In 'P1802_mittens_anchorYonedaHomLeg6', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, taxonomy leg tau_taxon: TaxonomyWitness(Felis catus, TSN 183798) -> D_Mittens(typeSeed) refining the cat classification" .
